# Route: guide 27 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 47 to
# 49, 33 quests, 2.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Teldrassil, Stormwind City, Badlands, Tanaris): near
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Rut'theran Village ->
# near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> Dustwind Gulch -> Hammertoe's
# Digsite -> Lethlor Ravine -> Hammertoe's Digsite -> Camp Cagg -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Prayer to Elune (3378; Twilight
# Dark Shaman 47-48, Twilight Fire Guard 48-49, Twilight Geomancer 49-50,
# Twilight Idolater 49-51); The Perenolde Tiara (543; Grel'borg the Miser 39);
# Tremors of the Earth (717; Blacklash 50, Hematus 50); The Super Snapper FX
# (2944; Gammerita 48).
#
# Left out: Tears of the Moon (2518), Crown of the Earth (934), Tumors (923):
# the route takes them here but cannot finish them (the coverage report's
# missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), In
# Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), Quell The Uprising (387),
# Quell the Uprising (387), The Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood
# (388), The Stockade Riots (391), The Stockade Riots (391), Underground
# Assault (2040), Underground Assault (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green
# Sample (92456), A Green Sample (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power
# Overwhelming (92489), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets
# (4729), En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862), Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells
# (2865), Troll Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle
# (3447), The Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final
# Tablets (4788).

